</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I watch to shun the miry way,</l><l>And staunch the springs of guilty thought;</l><l>But, watch and struggle as I may,</l><l>Pure I am not, pure I am not.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>If clearer vision Thou impart,</l><l>Grateful and glad my soul shall be,</l><l>But yet to have a purer heart</l><l>Is more to me, is more to me.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Yea, only as this heart is clean</l><l>May larger vision yet be mine,</l><l>For mirrored in the depths are seen</l><l>The things divine, the things divine.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
